   111	<li>Augury, <a href="https://www.augury.com/machine-health/">Machine Health</a>.</li>
   112	<li>SKF, <a href="https://cdn.skfmediahub.skf.com/api/public/0901d1968043cda1/pdf_preview_medium/0901d1968043cda1_pdf_preview_medium.pdf">Assessing, managing and monitoring machine health</a>.</li>
   113	<li>IBM, <a href="https://www.ibm.com/products/maximo/asset-performance-management">Maximo Asset Performance Management</a>.</li>
