    18	8. Receipts: every CHECK marker's row supports the sentence it follows; every verified row has
    19	   an excerpt that says what the claim says; inference rows are honest about what they infer.
    20	9. Verdict: is it the one the evidence earns, and is the kill assumption the right one?
    21	10. Readability: wall paragraphs, sentences over 40 words, jargon without mechanism.
    22	
    23	End with: verdict SHIP / REVISE / BLOCK, and the three fixes that matter most.

